+ *
+ * Rebuilt with pptxgenjs only. The original deck leans on a torn-paper look:
+ * every ragged edge below is a custGeom polygon whose points are stored as
+ * fractions of the shape's own bounding box, so one outline can be stretched
+ * into a page badge, a button or a full-bleed band.
+ *
+ * Photographs in the source are stand-in "insert image" plates; they are
+ * reproduced here as flat rectangles labelled [image].
+ */
